# 2024年真题 — 小作文


## 题型概述

| 项目 | 说明 |
|------|------|
| 分值 | 10 分 |
| 字数 | 约 100 词 |
| 形式 | 应用文：书信、通知、备忘录等 |

## 常见小作文类型 ⭐

| 类型 | 开头 | 结尾 |
|------|------|------|
| 建议信 | I am writing to offer some suggestions... | I hope you will find these suggestions helpful. |
| 邀请信 | I am writing to invite you to... | I look forward to your favorable reply. |
| 感谢信 | I am writing to express my gratitude... | Thank you again for your kindness. |
| 道歉信 | I am writing to apologize for... | I sincerely hope you can accept my apology. |
| 推荐信 | I am writing to recommend... | I am confident that... will be an excellent choice. |
| 申请信 | I am writing to apply for... | I would appreciate the opportunity to... |
| 通知 | Notice / Announcement | 发文单位 + 日期 |

## 2024年小作文精析

### 题目要求
（2024年小作文为邀请信：邀请外国教授参加学校举办的学术研讨会。）

### 写作框架

**第一段**：自我介绍 + 写信目的
> I am Li Ming, a graduate student from XX University. I am writing to cordially invite you to attend our annual academic symposium.

**第二段**：活动详情（时间、地点、主题）
> The symposium will be held on December 15th, 2024 at the university conference center. The theme of this year's event is "Innovation in Sustainable Development." Given your expertise in this field, we would be honored if you could deliver a keynote speech.

**第三段**：期望回复
> I would be grateful if you could confirm your availability at your earliest convenience. We look forward to your participation.

### 参考范文

> Dear Professor Smith,
>
> I am Li Ming, a postgraduate student from the School of Environmental Science at Peking University. On behalf of the organizing committee, I am writing to cordially invite you to our annual International Academic Symposium on Sustainable Development, which will be held on December 15th, 2024.
>
> The symposium will bring together scholars from around the world to discuss the latest research in environmental protection and green technology. Given your outstanding contributions to this field, we would be deeply honored if you could deliver a keynote speech on "Climate Change Mitigation Strategies." We will cover your travel and accommodation expenses.
>
> I would appreciate it if you could confirm your participation by November 30th. Please feel free to contact me if you have any questions. We eagerly look forward to welcoming you.
>
> Yours sincerely,
> Li Ming

## 评分要点与易错点 ⚠️

1. **格式不能错**：称呼、落款、分段必须正确
2. **字数别太少**：低于 80 词扣分
3. **不要漏要点**：题目要求的每个要点都要覆盖
4. **语言得体**：正式信函用正式语气
5. **时间分配**：15-20 分钟
